{"name":"Nathoud","status":"ok","title":"Nathoud","pageId":59769,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Nathoud</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VII-p86-88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Fortified town</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rashemen\" title=\"Rashemen\">Rashemen</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Hordelands\" title=\"Hordelands\">Hordelands</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Commerce</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"exports\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Exports</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Horses</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Nathoud (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6SW5oYWJpdGFudHNfb2ZfTmF0aG91ZD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Inhabitants of  Nathoud</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Events in Nathoud (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6RXZlbnRzX2luX05hdGhvdWQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Events in  Nathoud</span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Nathoud </b> was a fortified town located in the northern region of the <a href=\"/wiki/Hordelands\" title=\"Hordelands\">Hordelands</a> bordering <a href=\"/wiki/Rashemen\" title=\"Rashemen\">Rashemen</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VII-p86-88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nathoud?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Nathoud sat in the hill country at the feet of the southern slopes of the <a href=\"/wiki/Icerim_Mountains\" title=\"Icerim Mountains\">Icerim Mountains</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VII-p86-88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Wood was used in the construction of Nathoud since stone-working was little known in the region. The buildings of Nathoud were typically two stories tall and had large overhanging eaves with gently sloping roofs. Elaborate carvings decorated most buildings.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VII-p86-88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nathoud?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Myir\" title=\"Myir\">Myir</a>, a clan of <a href=\"/wiki/Nar_(ethnicity)\" title=\"Nar (ethnicity)\">Nars</a>, originally built the town when they came to settle, since they could not compete with the fierce <span class=\"new\" title=\"Khassadi (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvS2hhc3NhZGk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Khassadi</span> horsemen of the region.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VII-p86-88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The Myir of Nathoud were famous for their breeding of the <a href=\"/wiki/Nathoudi_stallion\" title=\"Nathoudi stallion\">Nathoudi stallion</a>. A yearly horse fair was held in Nathoud. Vendors interested in selling horses during this time needed to apply for a license. Races were held where vendors and horse-breeders could show off their prized animals.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VII-p86-88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nathoud?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nathoud?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-TH.VII-p86-88-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-3\">1.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-4\">1.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-5\">1.5</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/David_Cook\" title=\"David Cook\">David Cook</a>&#160;(August 1990). “Volume II”. In <a href=\"/wiki/Steve_Winter\" title=\"Steve Winter\">Steve Winter</a>&#160;ed. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Horde\" title=\"The Horde\">The Horde</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a>), pp. 86–88. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-88038-868-4\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-88038-868-4\">0-88038-868-4</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021191402\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.080 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 766/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1714/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 704/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1979/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   64.959      1 -total\n 74.03%   48.090      1 Template:Location\n 19.74%   12.820      1 Template:Refs\n 11.01%    7.149      1 Template:Cite_book/The_Horde/Volume_II\n  9.25%    6.008      1 Template:Cite_book\n  7.42%    4.818      1 Template:Cite_publication\n  2.68%    1.744      1 Template:MakeUnionCatLink\n  1.96%    1.276      1 Template:FormatPageNumbers\n  1.79%    1.161      2 Template:FormatAlias\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_forgottenrealms:pcache:idhash:59769-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261021191402 and revision id 974426. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","error":null,"source":{"wiki":"forgottenrealms.fandom.com","url":"https: